+4.  **Compute Color Regularization Loss ($\mathcal{L}_{NLL}$):** Estimate the likelihood of rendered color patches using the pre-trained Normalizing Flow model [S1]. Let $\phi$ be the learned bijection from patches to $\mathbb{R}^d$ where $d = S_{patch} \cdot S_{patch} \cdot 3$, and $p_z$ be the Gaussian latent distribution [S1]:
